<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan PM says Bhutto, husband, to be charged.</title>
<headline>Pakistan PM says Bhutto, husband, to be charged.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's caretaker Prime Minister Meraj Khalid said on Sunday that undisclosed charges would be brought against ousted prime minister Benazir Bhutto and her detained husband Asif Ali Zardari.</p>
<p>Asked if the government was preparing charges against Bhutto, Khalid told reporters: &quot;Yes, yes.&quot; Asked if they would include criminal charges, he said: &quot;All kinds of charges.&quot;</p>
</text>
